<rml>
<head>
	<!-- The private and offline shop signs (uiprivateshopbuilder.py
	     PrivateShopAdvertisementBoard, and PrivateShopTitleBar for a
	     decorated offline shop's style 1 to 5): one sign over each shop,
	     its name centered on the shop owner's position raised 220 units and
	     projected (chr.GetProjectPosition). While the shop-signs flag is on,
	     the Interface makes one facade per sign, nui_shop_signs.ShopSign
	     (controller assets/root/nui_shop_signs.py), and every sign is an entry
	     of this one document (spec D18). Each anchor places itself every
	     frame, where legacy positioned each sign from Python every frame.
	     Wave 5's rule picks the signs that show: the own, the target's and
	     the hovered one's always (s.always), with the sales texts on (the
	     system.show_sales_text feed, the game option) also the nearest
	     (s.near); the controller works it out when a sign comes or goes and
	     once a second at the timer's end (tick), not every frame. A visited
	     shop's plain sign is tinted (is-seen); a decorated one draws its
	     style: OLD's pattern art around it in every skin (components/sign-pattern.rcss,
	     NOVA-170). A release of the left button on a sign opens the shop
	     (net.SendOnClickPacket). The names are shown as written, their color
	     tags drawn and links not (nui-text links="off"). Each repeated slot
	     binds nothing: RmlUi updates a repeated element's own views with the
	     data-for that removes it. The classic thin board art is under
	     d:/ymir work/ (assets/ETC). -->
	<title>shop-signs</title>
	<link type="text/template" href="../../nui.rtpl"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../../components/sign-pattern.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="shop-signs.rcss"/>
</head>
<body template="nui" class="nui-overlay nui-below-legacy-ui shop-signs" data-model="shop_signs">
	<div class="shop-signs__slot" data-for="s : signs">
		<nui-anchor class="shop-signs__anchor" mode="project" height="220" data-attr-vid="s.vid"
			data-attr-id="'shop-sign-' + s.vid" data-if="s.shown &amp;&amp; (s.always || (show_all &amp;&amp; s.near))"><div
			class="nui-panel shop-sign nui-interactive" data-class-shop-sign--style-1="s.style == 1"
			data-class-shop-sign--style-2="s.style == 2" data-class-shop-sign--style-3="s.style == 3"
			data-class-shop-sign--style-4="s.style == 4" data-class-shop-sign--style-5="s.style == 5"
			data-class-nui-sign-pattern="s.style &gt; 0" data-class-nui-sign-pattern--1="s.style == 1"
			data-class-nui-sign-pattern--2="s.style == 2" data-class-nui-sign-pattern--3="s.style == 3"
			data-class-nui-sign-pattern--4="s.style == 4" data-class-nui-sign-pattern--5="s.style == 5"
			data-class-is-seen="s.seen" data-style---legacy-width="s.legacy_width" data-event-mouseup="open(s.vid, ev.button)"><nui-text
			class="shop-sign__text" links="off" data-attr-value="s.text"/><span class="nui-sign-pattern__part nui-sign-pattern__part--lt"
			data-if="s.style &gt; 0"></span><span class="nui-sign-pattern__part nui-sign-pattern__part--rt" data-if="s.style &gt; 0"></span><span
			class="nui-sign-pattern__part nui-sign-pattern__part--lb" data-if="s.style &gt; 0"></span><span
			class="nui-sign-pattern__part nui-sign-pattern__part--rb" data-if="s.style &gt; 0"></span><span
			class="nui-sign-pattern__part nui-sign-pattern__part--l" data-if="s.style &gt; 0"></span><span
			class="nui-sign-pattern__part nui-sign-pattern__part--r" data-if="s.style &gt; 0"></span><span
			class="nui-sign-pattern__part nui-sign-pattern__part--t" data-if="s.style &gt; 0"></span><span
			class="nui-sign-pattern__part nui-sign-pattern__part--b" data-if="s.style &gt; 0"></span></div></nui-anchor>
	</div>
	<nui-countdown class="shop-signs__tick" format="none" data-attr-end="tick_end" data-event-countdownend="tick()"/>
</body>
</rml>
